[[2047,96,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a></p><p>1. Rotate the sensor in an anti-clockwise direction and extract\nit.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection for the sensor (2a, 2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Lower treated air sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236692\">K87B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Lower treated air sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236691\">K87A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018332.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,96,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the sensor is not damaged.</p><p>Connect the sensor electrical connection.</p><p>Place the sensor in its housing and rotate\nit until it is in the end of travel position.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a></p><p>Check the operation of the system using\nthe Examiner or the other diagnostic equipment.</p>"]]